WEBVTT

exam_officer-001
00:00:00.277 --> 00:00:05.518
Welcome, Exam Officer, open your school’s
short link and check its crest, motto and

exam_officer-002
00:00:05.518 --> 00:00:08.675
colours before entering your assessment
workspace.

exam_officer-003
00:00:09.317 --> 00:00:13.920
Staff use a registered phone number and
four-digit PIN, with no email needed,

exam_officer-004
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.311
while the owner uses email and password.

exam_officer-005
00:00:17.128 --> 00:00:22.071
Install school app adds the school crest
and name to your home screen, or use

exam_officer-006
00:00:22.071 --> 00:00:24.895
Safari, Share, Add to Home Screen on
iPhone.

exam_officer-007
00:00:25.786 --> 00:00:30.731
Track missing exam papers, review
submissions, return corrections or approve

exam_officer-008
00:00:30.731 --> 00:00:33.919
them, then use the existing PDF and Word
exports.

exam_officer-009
00:00:34.822 --> 00:00:39.602
A dual-role teacher keeps one login for My
Class and My Subjects, with marks attached

exam_officer-010
00:00:39.602 --> 00:00:41.120
to their assigned learners.

exam_officer-011
00:00:42.037 --> 00:00:46.668
Teachers can draft CA and exam scores
offline after online sign-in, then sync

exam_officer-012
00:00:46.668 --> 00:00:51.118
automatically on reconnect, so confirm the
latest marks before publishing.

exam_officer-013
00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:56.899
Conventional schools keep academic terms,
while enabled Islamic or dual-stream

exam_officer-014
00:00:56.899 --> 00:01:00.721
schools add optional Tahfeez, Halqahs,
Surah and Ayah progress.

exam_officer-015
00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:06.460
Check the same fixed A4 report on phone,
tablet and computer, inspect every print

exam_officer-016
00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:10.800
margin, and release results only through
the approved publication process.
